msgstr "Propriété où enregistrer le texte brut"

#: src/Form/ConfigForm.php:368
msgid ""
"The text saved here is the plain-text rendering of the OCR, whatever its "
"origin: pdftotext on a pdf source, tesseract on images, parsing of an "
"existing alto or hocr, hint from any other extraction process. Applied to "
"every store target selected above: the item, the source resource and/or the "
"created extracted resource. Recommended values are "
"\"extracttext:extracted_text\" or \"bibo:content\"."
msgstr ""

